    "created_at": "2024-06-12T09:57:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-06-12T09:57:46Z",
    "body": "> It's not clear when a character is consumed, is it discarded from the input stream or not?\r\n\r\nThe spec doesn't say to discard. However, https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#algorithm-conformance applies:\r\n\r\n> Conformance requirements phrased as algorithms or specific steps may be implemented in any manner, so long as the end result is equivalent.\r\n\r\nI believe that applies to your other questions as well. The spec needs to define things in *some* way that is well-defined. If you wish to implement it differently, that is ok if the end result is the same.",
